ain.go compiles with go build -o bin/vdir ./cmd/vdir/\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"R1.5 behavior matches the SRD specification\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"R1.6 behavior matches the SRD specification\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"R2.1 behavior matches the SRD specification\"\n      - id: AC5\n        text: \"R2.2 behavior matches the SRD specification\"\n      - id: AC6\n        text: \"Existing functionality for R1.1-R1.4 is preserved unchanged\"\n      - id: AC7\n        text: \"go vet ./cmd/vdir/ reports no issues\"\n```\n\n**Summary:** 4 tasks proposed for release 13.0. Tasks 0-1 complete cmd/dir (1 remaining requirement: R2.4, split into implementation and test). Tasks 2-3 begin cmd/vdir implementation (8 of 10 requirements: R1.1-R1.6, R2.1-R2.2). Remaining vdir work (R2.3-R2.4 implementation + all vdir tests) deferred to the next batch."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44501,"cache_read_input_tokens":11845,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44501},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"487983ae-ee6e-429a-943a-9b3d46fcc4ee","uuid":"b033143b-d7e2-44b8-9fbe-e3c6f7ef36db"}
